Package: populismLLM
Title: Cross-Validated LLM Annotation of European Party Manifestos
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Martin", "Rode", email = "martinrode@unav.es",
           role = c("aut")),
    person("Sebastian", "Stöckl", email = "sebastian.stoeckl@uni.li",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(URL = "http://www.sebastianstoeckl.com")))
Description: Pipeline and replication code for scoring European party
    manifestos on populism and liberalism dimensions using three independent
    large language models (Claude Sonnet 4.6, GPT-4.1-mini, Gemini Flash),
    with a 8,100-cell specification-curve robustness analysis.
